@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered
Unregistered --> Registered : Create Account
Registered --> [*]
Registered --> AccountInfoView : View Account Info
Registered --> ChangingUsername : Change Username
Registered --> ChangingPassword : Change Password
AccountInfoView --> [*]
AccountInfoView --> ChangingUsername : Change Username
AccountInfoView --> ChangingPassword : Change Password
ChangingUsername --> UpdatingUsername : Update Username
ChangingPassword --> UpdatingPassword : Update Password
UpdatingUsername --> AccountInfoView : Return to Info View
UpdatingPassword --> AccountInfoView : Return to Info View
Registered --> LoggedIn : Login
LoggedIn --> AccountInfoView : View Info
LoggedIn --> ChangingUsername : Change Username
LoggedIn --> ChangingPassword : Change Password
LoggedIn --> Registered : Logout
@enduml
